  description: Found among isolated peoples untouched by Imperial civilisation, these
    primitive warriors practise neither formal martial arts nor structured cultivation.
    Nevertheless, generations of survival in unforgiving environments have granted
    them remarkable physical strength and instinct. Imperial scholars continue to
    debate whether their abilities represent an unconscious form of Aura cultivation.
